| 1500 | constrained | 78/1536 | 0 | 1458 | 2.631ms | 3.48–22.54Mbps | 1,044–4,865pps | 7.77ms | 1452/1472B |
| 1500 | receiver stall | 166/1536 | 0 | 1370 | 29.864ms | 6.94–7.03Mbps | 1,171–1,194pps | 8.15ms | 1452/1472B |
| 1500 | mixed | 1536/1536 | 0 | 0 | 0.069ms | 358.01–426.73Mbps | 57,949–69,410pps | 15.11ms | 1452/1472B |
| 4096 | nominal | 1536/1536 | 0 | 0 | 0.065ms | 655.74–894.13Mbps | 46,952–64,159pps | 20.80ms | 4048/4068B |
| 4096 | constrained | 20/1536 | 0 | 1516 | 3.111ms | 3.23–3.83Mbps | 527–626pps | 9.90ms | 4048/4068B |
| 4096 | receiver stall | 90/1536 | 0 | 1446 | 32.949ms | 6.41–7.34Mbps | 564–652pps | 10.06ms | 4048/4068B |
| 4096 | mixed | 1536/1536 | 0 | 0 | 0.043ms | 658.83–904.36Mbps | 47,173–64,893pps | 20.81ms | 4048/4068B |
| 8500 | nominal | 1536/1536 | 0 | 0 | 0.041ms | 1085.78–1258.89Mbps | 39,950–46,371pps | 30.30ms | 8452/8472B |
| 8500 | constrained | 34/1536 | 768 | 734 | 2.971ms | 3.18–3.74Mbps | 888–1,090pps | 9.10ms | 768B |
