swift test
swift format lint Sources/ReluxTunnelHarnessSupport/MTUMatrixCommand.swift Sources/ReluxTunnelHarnessSupport/SmokeCommand.swift Tests/ReluxTunnelHarnessTests/HarnessTests.swift
```

